*> PROGRAM : PEN0002
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-06-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 896
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0002.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0002C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> PENALTY WAIVER FLAG
    05 PENALTY-WAIVED     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 3000-WAIVER-RULES
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-WAIVED=" PENALTY-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
3000-WAIVER-RULES.
    IF FIRST-OFFENSE = 'Y'
        *> PREMIUM FIRST-OFFENCE WAIVER
        IF CUSTOMER-TIER = 'G' OR 'P'
            MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO PENALTY-AMT
        ELSE
            *> GRACE PERIOD WAIVER
            IF DAYS-PAST-DUE <= 3
                MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
                MOVE 0 TO PENALTY-AMT
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
